// Super Leader sequences. Tap LEADER (FN+L), then the sequence keys below,
// each within SUPER_LEADER_TIMEOUT (default 1000ms) of the last.
//
// SEQ_KEY(name, (keys...), output_keycode)
// SEQ_STR(name, (keys...), "string")
// SEQ_UNI(name, (keys...), "unicode string")
//
// Add more of your own here -- see modules/getreuer/super_leader/README.md.

// LEADER, then the physical keys that read "B", "O", "O", "T" on Dvorak
// keycaps -> reboot into the bootloader (for flashing). These are QWERTY
// firmware keycodes naming physical positions (fires before the OS's Dvorak
// layer sees anything, same as everywhere else in this keymap), chosen so
// the sequence still spells BOOT on hardware with Dvorak-printed keycaps:
// physical N/S/S/K are what Dvorak maps to B/O/O/T respectively.
SEQ_KEY(boot, (KC_N, KC_S, KC_S, KC_K), QK_BOOT)
